<title>FINLAND: TABLE - FINLAND BANK AUG LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.61 BLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINLAND BANK AUG LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.61 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 6.61 million markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for August 8		    4,250</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for August	   6,546</p>
<p> Average reserves to August 5			 6,228</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,607</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
